%p Hi #{@user.full_name.presence || @user.email},
%p Your Strutis account has been locked due to too many failed sign-in attempts. You can unlock it through the link below:
%p{ style: 'margin: 16px 0;' }
  = link_to 'Unlock my account', unlock_user_url(@user, unlock_token: @token)
%p If you didn't try to sign in, ignore this email and your account will remain locked.
